  "identity_by_window_sketch": "For one account and window, net_gain is the residual ending_value minus beginning_value minus net_additions, so the tie is graded on its inputs rather than on the residual: beginning_value and ending_value are market_value_eod on the window's two endpoint days and net_additions is external_flow summed over the trading days between them. A window whose inputs fail to reconcile against the activity table's window_identity_tolerance (0.05 USD per account per window) points at a flow missed or double counted across a skipped closure."
